  "metadata": {
    "title": "Construction Experiment of Multigauge Interference Readout Conserved Quantities in an ABC Closed Phase System",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21332875",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-13",
    "description": "This release publishes a numerical constructive experiment on whether mass-like, momentum-like, and energy-like conserved readouts can be constructed from multigauge interference in an ABC closed phase system without assuming background coordinates. The paper reconstructs p_read, E_read, and R_read from multiple gauges, diagnoses the failure of simple q -&gt; -q reversal under asymmetric R, and constructs an R-weighted generalized collision map conserving R*p and R*p^2. The release includes Japanese and English manuscripts, TeX/PDF builds, executed numerical scripts, result JSON/CSV files, figures, verification notes, and a reproducibility bundle.",
